#: scenario8:scenario8_B77B9324_C68A_4471_972E_2BC1BEA37683
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5442d01376cb32cec5828e86afa888291e117b148245830e05670eac6524dbf8
