msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B77B9324_C68A_4471_972E_2BC1BEA37683"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wha— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That can’t be right...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I’m sure I’ve been smiling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Che— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫N-⟪k:5⟫Non può essere...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Sono sicuro di aver già sorriso "
"prima."

#: scenario8:scenario8_71D278E8_A4E6_4699_99AB_D18D8754EC03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c1b20af3e185ffe2c636acba03391b0140de01b3f4956a50b17b4ede1189a6d
#. default-sha256: dd10a03e1b1f47eebc338d9c899d9aa0877e40af1f0764ad2521fa6bbcd86661
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_71D278E8_A4E6_4699_99AB_D18D8754EC03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m really glad you decided to come with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sono davvero felice che tu abbia deciso di venire con me."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD72C044_BFA1_41D0_8B39_3193E6CED39F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37837ab20a0e054c4ee581a4f695a0c59a07aab032c20d0cae3d1ea27e2777e6
#. default-sha256: f022cdf56c29577df1d558ffeb158c340384f125f1711d21e36eb16e038fe5ac
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD72C044_BFA1_41D0_8B39_3193E6CED39F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Until that day, I had never known how good it felt to have someone who wanted me "
"in their life—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fino a quel giorno, non sapevo quanto mi facesse stare bene avere qualcuno che mi "
"desiderava nella propria vita—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DCB637E0_5BB5_4D40_BF49_0311E5C87F0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a6972bf680caad5754a4ecf1171ff7675af2ce267c04b35daae891d29da0f2f
#. default-sha256: 1297d4dc485cba395c2843ed27c1f4fcca081a750db886e631dc4491bbb10def
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DCB637E0_5BB5_4D40_BF49_0311E5C87F0E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫who saw me for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫che mi vedeva per quello che ero."

#: scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93eff1b223b720939570eddd239478c53b14aec13590577307fbd1dfbfe39428
#. default-sha256: a354c386f22a85d3a553ab5beff1f450c6498e526462de7adb13b7e0189bc64f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was hardly prince material—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wasn’t strong or handsome or regal enough for that—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non avevo la stoffa del principe—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫non ero abbastanza forte, bello o regale per "
"esserlo—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_75447CBB_525D_40EE_A675_182108C12D34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 484cfdd06b2ae0f2bcdee7df4bb2c397705fa7d770176c28958fc93835366b47
#. default-sha256: 7d8f132dcee3bac122304a1091a5645c628504c6be02083ede8eaa529cdd9f5c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_75447CBB_525D_40EE_A675_182108C12D34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“I’m staying home because I want to be with you as much as possible.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫“Rimango a casa perché voglio stare con te il più possibile.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8D5AB42A_967E_45D3_B838_B7700592D49C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0eb20653528c831d088b95abe7ad32bfd4ab07ac4bc4a9950fde7ef31afb82f0
#. default-sha256: b67fda0208f7075d0bc9a41537c5821561141433544ebee182a24e4297a5f6fd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8D5AB42A_967E_45D3_B838_B7700592D49C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Welcome home, dearest Mell! What did you buy today?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Bentornato a casa, caro Mell! Cos’hai comprato oggi?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2d46de903b434e62dcf512eec612430f563c9bdab3e13304608111b1275646a
#. default-sha256: 3862457792e7fb56a2050e10e16fa01c7e4da61cc7b5e14a46d7ea7245773208
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wow! I’ve never seen one so up close before!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are we going to keep it as a pet?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wow! Non ne ho mai visto uno così da vicino!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vuoi tenerlo come animale "
"domestico?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B6DAF2C0_14E5_41D0_9248_6F5891F8439C
