#: scenario8:scenario8_E681D104_B68C_446D_B5FE_E46E6C1477B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed2f9d32d50179ec79c8be9cd62e39f021f5a5c0c1f946f2d79c6136c7a1c48f
