msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But it’s all... ⟪k:2⟫covered in feathers and flapping about...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫How are we "
"supposed to cook it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ tutto ricoperto di piume, ⟪k:4⟫e si agita...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Come facciamo a "
"cucinarlo?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30426D9F_11EC_4A91_8E52_B06B67C70361
