#: scenario8:scenario8_8679902E_3CEE_4D0F_88B8_EFC38308A715
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8829e69dca8e07f95bf7468a3debc4e511498912217feaf6f0457f2144117016
#. default-sha256: 0b1f414f4b992f26c6827e0dffb0ada5ebd096b66a45480ba21aa98c2ec66c8f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8679902E_3CEE_4D0F_88B8_EFC38308A715"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Back home, Nellie had tended to be, ⟪k:1⟫well, ⟪k:2⟫a bit of a princess.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was "
"frequently harsh with the abigails, scolding them for the smallest of things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nella nostra vecchia casa, Nellie tendeva a comportarsi... ⟪k:1⟫insomma,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫un po’ "
"troppo da principessa.⟪k:4⟫ Era molto severa con le domestiche,⟪k:5⟫rimproverandole spesso per le "
"cose più piccole."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4DA95E7E_E2AA_4ABF_B734_EE7BF10DA8B0
